From 278ace6ecde4ab1c556142ce224284e665d779fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris <meischris39@hotmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 03:21:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] CB1: read framebuffer bit depths the core-profile way on
 desktop GL

Core profiles dropped GL_RED_BITS and friends and call the default
colour buffer GL_BACK_LEFT, so the packer and the final-framebuffer
check read garbage depths and left INVALID_ENUM pending on desktop GL.
---
 config/owned-sources.json |  6 +++---
 src/dvbridge_gl_api.h     | 14 ++++++++++++++
 src/dvbridge_gl_pack.c    | 10 +++++++++-
 src/dvbridge_render.c     |  7 ++++++-
 4 files changed, 32 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/config/owned-sources.json b/config/owned-sources.json
index 4c567c4..5209555 100644
